    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμονιά</span></b>  [prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
